  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/illusion-of-transparency/s1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> "2026-11-03"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/illusion-of-transparency/s1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "Gilovich, Savitsky & Medvec, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 75(2), 332-346, 1998 (PubMed record)" .
