  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/high-and-low-context-cultures> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/audience-analysis> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/high-and-low-context-cultures> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/direct-vs-indirect-feedback> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/high-and-low-context-cultures> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/hofstede-cultural-dimensions> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/high-and-low-context-cultures> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/high-and-low-context-cultures/s1> .
