<https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I about to describe what happened, or to deliver a verdict on the person who did it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Have I signalled that the outcome is still open, or does my message sound like the decision is already made?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "When I felt criticised just now, did I restate their point before I explained or justified myself?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the other person reacting to my content, or to a tone of superiority, certainty or hidden agenda they are picking up?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/defensiveness> .
