  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/zoom-fatigue/s6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#Source> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/zoom-fatigue/s6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#sourceType> "peer-reviewed" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/zoom-fatigue/s6> <https://schema.org/url> <https://www.emerald.com/insight/content/doi/10.1108/INTR-07-2021-0499> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does this conversation need video at all, or would a phone call, a shared document or a written update do the job?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Have I booked video meetings back to back with no break to stand up, move or look away from the screen?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I watching my own tile more than the people I am talking to, and could I hide self-view?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Did I make it clear that cameras are optional for this meeting, especially for newer team members?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Did people have a moment to connect as a group, or did we go straight into a wall of faces and slides?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue/check/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-05"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#Barrier> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Zoom fatigue" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "video call fatigue" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "videoconference fatigue" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "videoconferencing fatigue" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/video-call-communication> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/workplace-meetings> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The tiredness and depletion people report after video meetings, linked to sustained close-up eye contact, the extra effort of sending and reading nonverbal cues on screen, watching a self-view and being kept still in front of a camera; it drains the energy people bring to later meetings and makes them less likely to speak up." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/scheme/digital-and-async-communication> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Zoom fatigue" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/asynchronous-communication> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/channel-selection> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/information-overload> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/media-richness-theory> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/proxemics> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/spotlight-effect> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/zoom-fatigue/s1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/zoom-fatigue> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/zoom-fatigue/s2> .
