<https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Can I name my manager's top two goals and the pressure they are under this quarter, from what they have told me rather than my guess?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Do I know whether my manager would rather read this in writing first or hear it live, and am I using that format?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Have we explicitly agreed what \"done\" looks like and when they want to hear from me, or am I assuming?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is there a problem or slipping date I have not told them about yet, and why am I waiting?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I spending their time and goodwill on something that truly needs them, and have I brought a proposed solution?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Would I be comfortable if my manager saw exactly how I prepared for this conversation, or does it rely on flattery or spin?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up/check/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/managing-up> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#Skill> .
