  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/situation-behavior-impact/s6> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "Shera Clark, Center for Creative Leadership, 2013 (O'Reilly Online Learning)" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/situation-behavior-impact/s6> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Feedback That Works for Nonprofit Organizations - Delivering Effective Feedback" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/situation-behavior-impact/s6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#Source> .
