<https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Did I give this person my full attention, or was part of me on my screen or my next point?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Did I learn one thing about them as a person before we got into the business?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Before a hard negotiation or tense thread, have we ever spoken live, even for five minutes?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Did the setting and their cues invite small talk, or did they signal they wanted to get straight to work?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I trying to connect, or performing techniques such as copying their posture?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport/check/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#Concept> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Rapport" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "being in sync" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "building rapport" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "interpersonal rapport" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "rapport building" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/interpersonal-communication> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A shared, momentary quality of an interaction in which both people are attentive to each other, feel mutual warmth and move in coordination; it belongs to the pair rather than to either person, and it makes disclosure and cooperation easier." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/scheme/foundations> .
