  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/psychological-safety> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/self-disclosure> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rapport> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/small-talk> .
