  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/batna/s4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "Brett, Pinkley and Jackofsky, International Journal of Conflict Management 7(2), 121-138, 1996 (doi:10.1108/eb022778)" .
