  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/influence-without-authority> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/principled-negotiation> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/influence-without-authority> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/reciprocity> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/influence-without-authority> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/stakeholder-mapping> .
