<https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/speaking-anxiety/s1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> "2026-11-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/speaking-anxiety/s1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "Ebrahimi, Pallesen, Kenter & Nordgreen, Frontiers in Psychology 10:488, 2019" .
