  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/speaking-anxiety/s6> <https://schema.org/url> <https://hamilton.edu/academics/centers/oralcommunication/guides/dealing-with-speech-anxiety-1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I declining this presentation because it is not my job, or because I am afraid of it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Have I rehearsed this out loud, standing, at least once - or only read my notes silently?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I assuming the audience can see my nerves as clearly as I can feel them?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What is the one point I need them to leave with, if everything else goes badly?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Afterwards, am I judging the talk by how I felt or by what the audience actually did with it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety/check/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#Barrier> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Public speaking anxiety" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "fear of public speaking" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "glossophobia" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "speech anxiety" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "stage fright" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/communication-apprehension> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Fear and physical arousal triggered by having to speak in front of others - from a team update to a conference talk - that pushes people to avoid speaking, over-script, or deliver less well than they could." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/scheme/presenting-and-public-speaking> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Public speaking anxiety" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/anxiety-reappraisal> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/illusion-of-transparency> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/presentation-rehearsal> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/psychological-safety> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/social-anxiety> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/spotlight-effect> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/speaking-anxiety/s1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/speaking-anxiety/s2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/speaking-anxiety/s3> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/speaking-anxiety/s4> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/speaking-anxiety/s5> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/speaking-anxiety/s6> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#demonstratedBy> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/savitsky-gilovich-2003> .
