  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/speaking-anxiety> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#supportedBy> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/macinnis-mackinnon-macintyre-2010> .
