  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/teach-back> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/teach-back/s2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/teach-back> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/teach-back/s3> .
