<https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-03"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#Work> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Aristotle's Rhetoric" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Ars Rhetorica" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "On Rhetoric" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Rhetoric (Aristotle)" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Techne Rhetorike" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rhetoric> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Aristotle's fourth-century BCE treatise defining rhetoric as the ability to see the available means of persuasion in a given case; it introduced the three proofs of character, emotion and argument, and the first systematic analysis of how an audience shapes a speech." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/scheme/thinkers-and-works> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aristotle's Rhetoric" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/audience-analysis> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/audience> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/clarity> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/rhetorical-appeals> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/aristotles-rhetoric/s1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/aristotles-rhetoric/s2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/aristotles-rhetoric/s3> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/aristotles-rhetoric> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/aristotles-rhetoric/s4> .
